  "comments": "<p>Several varieties exist with differences in the building.<br><br>CJ# 4.2.2 - 1993 - South African Mint<br>&nbsp;(Entrance door pasted to the columns) (Year with thick numbers)</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/656b5e7c51ce0.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/656b5e7c51ce0.jpg\"></a><br>CJ# 4.2.3 - 1993 - South African Mint<br>&nbsp;(Entrance door with panel) (Year with thick numbers)<br>CJ# 4.2.4 - 1993 - Korea Mint<br>&nbsp;(Entrance door with a separation of the columns) (Year with <strong>thin</strong> numbers)<br>Picture: © Images courtesy of Alexandr Prokofyev<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6131d97b96beb.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6131d97b96beb.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br>CJ# 4.3.1 - 1994 - Royal Mint<br>&nbsp;(Entrance door with a separation of the columns) (Year with thin numbers)</p><p><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/656b5e8f97a77.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/656b5e8f97a77.jpg\"></a><br>CJ# 4.3.2 - 1994 - South African Mint<br>&nbsp;(Entrance door pasted to the columns) (Year with thick numbers)<br>CJ# 4.3.3 - 1994 - South African Mint<br>&nbsp;(Entrance door with panel) (Year with thick numbers)<br>Picture: © Images courtesy of Alexandr Prokofyev<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/6131d99c8763f.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/6131d99c8763f.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br>CJ# 4.3.4 - 1994 - South African Mint<br>&nbsp;(Entrance door with panel) (Year with thick numbers) (magnetic)<br>CJ# 4.4.1 - 1996 - South African Mint<br>&nbsp;(Entrance door with grid) (Year with thin numbers)<br>CJ# 4.4.2 - 1996 - South African Mint<br>&nbsp;(Entrance door with grid) (Year with thin numbers) (mirroring background)<br><br>The different towers<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5548b72f58989.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5548b72f58989.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/56dab2dc88759.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/56dab2dc88759.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/56dab301adfef.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/56dab301adfef.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a><br><br>On the coin from 1996 two varieties on the fence of the balcony on the tower: without and with vertical bars.<br><a href=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/5d9e50f6c2109.jpg\"><img src=\"https://en.numista.com/catalogue/images/miniatures/5d9e50f6c2109.jpg\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
